    "value": "*Mandatory inputs for a Product to show on the website:*\n\n*Product name*\n\n# Given a shopper lands on a PDP, when the page loads, then the product name is displayed prominently at the top of the product information panel, sourced from the SFCC product record.\n\n*Price*\n\n# Given a shopper lands on a PDP and the product has a single full price, when the page loads, then the full price is displayed beneath the product name in the currency of the active storefront.\n\n*Product description*\n\n# Given a shopper lands on a PDP, when the page loads, then the product description is displayed.\n\n*Product style code*\n\n# Given a shopper lands on a PDP, when the page loads, then the product style code is displayed.\n\n*Optional input:*\n\n*Model copy*\n\n# Given a product has \"Model is…\" copy populated in the relevant SFCC attribute, when the page loads, then the model height and size worn are displayed on the page.\n# Given a product does not have \"Model is…\" copy populated, when the page loads, then no model copy is displayed and no empty placeholder is shown.\n\n----\n\n*Breadcrumb navigation*\n\n# Given a shopper is on a PDP, when the page loads, then a breadcrumb trail is displayed underneath the product pictures reflecting the product's category path (e.g. HOME / NEW / DRESSES / [PRODUCT NAME]).\n# Given a shopper clicks a breadcrumb node, when the click is registered, then the shopper is navigated to the corresponding category page."
