        "name": "Epic",
        "subtask": false,
        "avatarId": 10307,
        "entityId": "e102bd1e-0f8b-4d64-a404-c3d025abab07",
        "hierarchyLevel": 1
      }
    }
  },
  "customfield_10231": {
    "value": "*Size selector — available sizes*\n\n* Given a shopper lands on a PDP, when the page loads, then all sizes for the selected colour variation are displayed in the size selector.\n* Given a size is in stock (stock exceeds the buffer threshold), when the size selector renders, then that size is displayed as selectable.\n* Given a product only has one size, when the page loads, then the size selector does not render but it should just display one size.\n\n*Size selector — unavailable sizes*\n\n* Given a size is unavailable (stock is zero or below buffer threshold), when the size selector renders, then that size is not selectable.\n* Given a size is unavailable, when the size selector renders, then a Notify Me CTA is displayed inline alongside that size.\n* Given all sizes are unavailable, when the size selector renders, then a Notify Me CTA is displayed inline alongside all sizes.\n\n*Low stock indicator*\n\n* Given a size variant's stock level has fallen below the configured low stock threshold, when the page loads, then a \"Low Availability\" indicator is displayed adjacent to that size.\n* Given the \"Low Availability\" indicator is displayed, when a shopper selects that size and clicks Add to Bag, then the Add to Bag action proceeds as normal and is not blocked.\n\n*Add to Bag CTA*\n\n* Given a shopper lands on a PDP and no size has been selected, when the page loads, then the Add to Bag CTA is displayed but inactive/disabled.\n* Given a shopper attempts to click on Add to Bag without selecting a size, then a message is displayed “Size required”.\n* Given a shopper selects an in-stock size (stock exceeds the buffer threshold), when the selection is registered, then the Add to Bag CTA becomes active and enabled.\n* Given a shopper selects a size and clicks Add to Bag, when the action is triggered, then the interaction is handled (cart is a separate user story but we can route to out-of-the-box SFCC cart page in this user story)."
  },
  "customfield_10016": {
    "value": 5.0
  },
  "customfield_10020": {
    "value": null
  }
}"}

