    "value": "# Given a shopper has viewed at least one product during their session, when they reach a page that contains the Recently Viewed component, then a horizontal rail of recently viewed product tiles is displayed, labelled \"Recently Viewed.\"\n# Given a shopper has viewed multiple products, then tiles are ordered most-recently-viewed first (left to right).\n# Given a recently viewed product tile is rendered, then it displays the product's index image.\n# Given a shopper clicks a recently viewed product tile, then they are navigated to that product's PDP.\n# Given the number of recently viewed products exceeds the visible rail width, then the “See Full History” link becomes available.\n# *Guest Shopper:* Given a guest shopper{color:#ff5630} {color}browses products within a session, when they navigate to a page with the Recently Viewed rail, then products viewed during that session are shown. When the browser session ends, the history is cleared.\n# *Authenticated Shopper:* Given an authenticated shopper has previously viewed products, when they log in on any device, then their Recently Viewed history is restored and displayed in the rail.\n# *Empty state:* Given a shopper has not viewed any products in their current session (and is not authenticated with any history), then the Recently Viewed component is not rendered on the page — no empty rail or placeholder is shown.\n# *Cross-page consistency:* Given the Recently Viewed component is embedded on PLP, PDP and anywhere else, then the same browsing history and tile design is shown consistently across all surfaces."
  },
